{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.letters",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "签名会前，她抱着一叠信",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.letters",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.letters",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "はるき，签名会的名额全满了，改成抽选了。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "诶……已经满了吗……？好厉害啊……！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。越来越有干劲了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "…………那个，先打招呼，一边聊一边签名……然后递过去……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "──咦？每个人大概有多少时间呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这次只签名，大概一分到一分半吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "好、好短……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "要让更多人参加的话，只能这样了……",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "一分钟……那得说快一点才行了────",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "────啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "没什么……！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "签名会，我会加油的……！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "text": "第二天早上。她在事务所门口等着，怀里抱着一叠纸。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "制作人先生，早上好……！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "突然不好意思……！请看看这个……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──────……这是……",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "是写给粉丝的信……！",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不是写给特定某个人的……因为今天肯定没法跟每个人都说上话",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "不好意思，今天这个，可以发给来的人吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "内容没问题。发给大家，我觉得也可以。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "谢谢您……！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "所以，我想赶紧把这个数据按人数复印出来……在家里没法印",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……！还有时间，我们去印吧。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
